## Task → files map

| If the task is… | Read |
|---|---|
| Marketing, posts, ads, improving web/social | `brand.md` + `offering.md` + `market.md` |
| Replying to leads, prospect emails/messages | `sales.md` + `offering.md` + `brand.md` |
| Quotes, proposals, contracts | `sales.md` + `offering.md` + `INTERNAL.md` (confirm prices) |
| Reports, analysis, business decisions | `objectives.md` + `INTERNAL.md` + `market.md` |
| Operations, deliveries, team messages | `operations.md` + `company.md` |
| Pricing, margins, discounts | `INTERNAL.md` + `sales.md` |
| Who decides / delegation / legal questions | `company.md` |
| General question about the business | this file only; ask if more is needed |
